title: macOS Screen Capture via screencapture
id: a4be724b-387d-4912-ae50-b8ffe3313749
status: experimental
description: Detects use of the macOS screencapture utility with silent/no-sound flags (-x) writing to a file, a technique for covertly capturing the victim's screen.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1113/
logsource:
  product: macos
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|endswith: '/screencapture'
    CommandLine|contains: '-x'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - User
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Users taking screenshots
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.collection
  - attack.t1113
